{"ref":"BDB, גְּמוּל","hw":"גְּמוּל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גְּמוּל</span></big>  <strong>n.m. dealing, recompence, benefit</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:2\" href=\"/Psalms.94.2\">ψ 94:2</a> + 11 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּמֻלְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:15\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.15\">Ob 15</a>, etc.; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּמוּלָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:2\" href=\"/Psalms.103.2\">ψ 103:2</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּמוּל יָדַיִם</span> <em>dealing of the hands</em> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:16\" href=\"/Judges.9.16\">Ju 9:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.14\">Pr 12:14</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(יָשׁוּב לְ)</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.11\">Is 3:11</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(יֵעָשֶׂה לְ)</span>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>dealing</em>, hence (from context) <em>equivalent of dealing, recompence:</em> c. suff. <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:15\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.15\">Ob 15</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">גמלך ישׁוב בראשׁך</span>, <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:4\" href=\"/Joel.4.4\">Jo 4:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:7\" href=\"/Joel.4.7\">7</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(הֵשִׁיב)</span>, so with <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵשִׁיב לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 28:4\" href=\"/Psalms.28.4\">ψ 28:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁלֵּם לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 137:8\" href=\"/Psalms.137.8\">137:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.17\">Pr 19:17</a>; absolutely <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁלֵּם (הֵשִׁיב) גְּמוּל לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.18\">Is 59:18</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.6\">66:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.6\">Je 51:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:64\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.64\">La 3:64</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:4\" href=\"/Joel.4.4\">Jo 4:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:2\" href=\"/Psalms.94.2\">ψ 94:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.4\">Is 35:4</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳ אלהים</span> <em>the recompence of God</em>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>benefit:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">אַל תשׁכחי כל גמוליו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:2\" href=\"/Psalms.103.2\">ψ 103:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כגמול עליו</span> <em>according to the benefit</em> (done) <em>unto him</em> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.25\">2 Ch 32:25</a>","next":"BDB, גָּמוּל","prev":"BDB, גָּמַל"}